UID:163741@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260605T095755Z
DTSTART:20260624T160000Z
DTEND:20260624T173000Z
SUMMARY:ISO-NE System Forecasting Public Webinar
LOCATION:Microsoft Teams
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will host a virtual public webinar to present its system forecasting work and the 2026 Forecast Report of Capacity\, Energy\, Loads\, and Transmission (CELT Report). The webinar will summarize the ISO’s forecasting activities and key findings from the 2026 CELT Report and is intended for a general audience. Time will be allotted for questions\, and a recording will be posted following the event.\n\nRegistration is not required. You may join by accessing the meeting details provided below\, or add them to your calendar.\n\nAdd to My Calendar\n\nThis event will be held virtually via Teams:\n\nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/257752992743999?p=wDiRbrVZibWD4UigO6\n\nMeeting ID: 257 752 992 743 999\n\nPasscode: iw6Tf6Tm\nContact: Marissa Ribeiro Dahan (mribeirodahan@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163741
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163741
END:VEVENT
